sequenceDiagram
    participant CL as Control Loop
    participant SE as Scaling Engine
    participant WS as World State (Snapshot)
    participant HIS as Scaling History (in WS)

    CL->>SE: ComputeTargets(ctx, snapshot)
    loop For each Application
        SE->>WS: Get vLLMMetrics, PerformanceProfile
        
        Note over SE: computeTargetReplicas
        SE->>SE: 1. Check Queue Pressure (QueueHighWatermark)
        SE->>SE: 2. Check KV Cache Pressure (KVCacheHighWatermark)
        SE->>SE: 3. Check SLA Breach (max_p99_ttft_ms)
        SE->>SE: 4. Check Scale-Down Signal (Low utilization)
        SE->>SE: Select max(signals) as raw_target

        Note over SE: computeEffectiveTarget
        SE->>WS: Count Running & Pending Replicas
        SE->>SE: Check for Stale Pending Replicas (2x cold_start)
        SE->>SE: Adjust target to account for in-flight replicas

        Note over SE: applyStabilityControls
        SE->>HIS: Get Scaling History (LastScaleUpAt, LastScaleDownAt)
        alt target > current (Scale Up)
            SE->>SE: Check ScaleUpCooldown
        else target < current (Scale Down)
            SE->>SE: Check ScaleDownCooldown
            SE->>SE: Check Stabilization Window (consecutive signals)
            SE->>SE: Bypass if SLA Breach
        end

        SE->>SE: Finalize ScalingDecision (AppID, Target, Signal, SLABreach)
    end
    SE-->>CL: map[AppID]ScalingDecision
